== Walkthrough ==

Tell Suuspa Clanim in the Temple of Life in North Qeynos about Brother Trintle attacking Brother Estle and she is shocked and expresses the thought that Trintle must have been swayed by the words of Bertoxxulous. 

You Say: Brother Trintle Attacked Brother Estle.

: Suuspa Clanim says: "Impossible!! What madness do you speak off!!? If he did he must have had a reason. Maybe Trintle had been tainted by the words of Bertoxxulous..?

If you kill Brother Trintle in West Karanas you discover that indeed he is now a follower of Bertoxxulous.

'''Turn in [[Busted Prayer Beads]] to Suuspa'''

: Suusupa Clanim says: "This is not good. Hmph. It appears they are shattered. For the first time one of our members has been swayed. I reward you for your deed. Also, if you have found anything upon Trintle, let me know."

''She is referring to her [[Rat Shaped Rings]] quest.''

You receive 7 copper pieces.

